	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tuę literę, amicorum observabilissime, nunquam non fuerunt mihi <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>iucundissimę, quantumvis temporum iniuria omnia nunc <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>conturbet.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Concionem tuam super cęna domini ex alio exem<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>plari, antequam tuum ad me venerat, summa cum voluptate <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>spiritus legi, licet fere totum prius animo nostro gnaviter <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>impressum erat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Exquestori <persName ref="p182">Arnoldo</persName> exemplar <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>suum incunctanter transmisi; is quoque cum gaudio accepit <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>renuncians mihi principem <persName>Palatinum</persName> coactis aliquot <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>theologis, inter quas <persName ref="p458">Brenzius</persName> primas tenet, de ecclesię <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ordinatione consultare.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ego per literas, quantum in me <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>fuit, istos inanes conatus dissuasi haud utique ignorans <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quorundam opiniones et quam sinistre cedant humanę c<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>onstitutiones, praecipue ob id, quod nihil stabile inter tot dissidente<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>s inter se ceremonias constitui facile possit, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>augustior sinodus congre[ga]ta fuerit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Tua de cęna domini <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>concio <placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> mirificis laudibus per cordatos et pios <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>extollitur; hinc quoque ea mihi primum exhibita est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Ringatur papismus cum <persName>Lutheranismo</persName>; veritas in honorem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>patris per Christum progredietur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Princeps <placeName ref="l749">Saxonię</placeName> Augustus electorio munere fungi et <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>subditos electoratus sacramento sibi astringere incipit; is <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>etiam iam comitia frequentissim <placeName ref="l284">Lypzię</placeName> celebraturus est, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ubi magnates universi eius imperii confluent, equitum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nimirum ultra quinque millia non numerato priore exercitu, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>reliquiis nempe <persName ref="p18250">Mauricii</persName> fratris cęsi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Rumor est <persName>Augustum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>totum in hoc esse, ut mortem fratris non solum ulciscatur, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>verum etiam ipsius <persName ref="p18250">Mauricii</persName> inceptum negotium de recuperanda <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>libertate in finem deducat.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Habet is auxiliarios <persName ref="p3671">Danorum <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>regem</persName> et civitates percipuas(?), quę vocantur maritimę.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Marggravius <persName ref="p8371">Albertus</persName> viribus et belli nervis<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vgl. <hi>Cicero,</hi> Orationes Philippicae, 5, 5 und s. <bibl source="b17">HBBW XIV</bibl> *** .</note> ęger non <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>longe ab Hanubero civitate nititur equitem et militem <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>conscribere, quo ut aut Cęsari sit auxilio aut hostes episco<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>pos infestet.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">At o quam difficulter emersus est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Pax apud nos omnino dubia est tantum propter quarundam <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>civitatum regnandi et seviendi libidinem.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Summa: <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>res stant in veteri sabulo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName ref="p18982">Ionam</persName> meum alias optime tibi commendatum adhuc commendo.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Symblero, genero tuo, modo scribere non licuit; <persName>Ionas</persName> autem <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>meas literas iussu meo illi ostendet, ex quibus, quid velim, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>intelliget.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Capita urbis vestrę, protoscribam atque singulos sym<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>mistas tuos cum reliquis amicis ex me salutabis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Celerrime ex <placeName ref="l279">Lauginga</placeName> 1. septembris 1553.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p8354">Geo<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>rgius Lętus</persName> a <placeName>Lömnicz</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiastę <placeName ref="l587">Tygurin<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>orum</placeName> primario, amico et domino obser<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>vabili.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zu[rch]</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
